<Positioned left="40" top="10"><Text fontSize="32" color="#FFFFFFFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">从需求到可复现交付 · 依赖解释图</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="40" top="54"><Text fontSize="20" color="#94A3B8FF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">列 = 拓扑层（左→右）；同列节点互为并行分支；实线为有向先决依赖，虚线为反馈关系</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="1000" top="10" width="560"><Container alignment="CENTER_RIGHT"><Text fontSize="20" color="#5EEAD4FF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">14 节点 · 16 条先决边 · 2 条反馈边</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="1000" top="38" width="560"><Container alignment="CENTER_RIGHT"><Text fontSize="20" color="#FBBF24FF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">先决边只向右，无指向过去层的布局歧义</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="1000" top="64" width="560"><Container alignment="CENTER_RIGHT"><Text fontSize="20" color="#94A3B8FF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">交叉线无连接点即不构成依赖</Text></Container></Positioned>
